    {
      "name": "@kazuma-124/dsh-conversation-notebook",
      "title": {
        "en": "Conversation notebook",
        "zh": "对话记事本"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Choose Conversation notebook from the right sidebar guide to manually edit a separate note for each conversation. Changes save to this device’s disk. Archiving, restarting or clearing browser data does not delete saved notes. Old browser notes migrate automatically after upgrading; keep browser data until migration completes. Save failures retain drafts and concurrent updates report conflicts.",
        "zh": "在右侧栏入口页选择“对话记事本”，手动维护当前对话的独立笔记。输入后自动保存到本机磁盘，归档、重启或清除浏览器数据不会删除已保存的笔记。升级后自动迁移旧浏览器笔记；迁移完成前请保留旧浏览器数据。保存失败保留草稿，多窗口更新会提示冲突。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/conversation-notebook.svg",
      "author": "Kazuma-124",
