    {
      "name": "@kazuma-124/dsh-compaction-prompts",
      "title": {
        "en": "Compaction prompts",
        "zh": "压缩提示词"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Choose one compaction prompt for all sessions in Settings → Compaction prompts. Use a custom prompt, follow the installed DSH official version, or pin an official snapshot. Startup synchronizes official content and preserves new snapshots without changing your selection. Existing active/presets prompts are imported once.",
        "zh": "在设置 → 压缩提示词中，为所有会话选择一个压缩提示词。支持自定义提示词、跟随当前 DSH 官方版本，以及固定使用官方历史快照。启动时自动同步官方内容；内容变化时新增快照并保留当前选择。旧 active/presets 提示词首次自动导入。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/dsh-compaction-prompts.svg",
      "author": "Kazuma-124",
