    {
      "name": "@kazuma-124/dsh-workspace-session-migration",
      "title": {
        "en": "Workspace session migration",
        "zh": "工作区会话迁移"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a workspace migration page to the sidebar: select sessions in one workspace, choose a target, and migrate them; the original log moves to a backup or is archived. Also provides two Agent tools. Local session-log access only; no model calls, no network.",
        "zh": "在左侧栏新增「工作区迁移」页：勾选源工作区的会话、选择目标工作区即可复制迁移，原日志进备份或归档。同时提供两个 Agent 工具。只在本机读写 DSH 会话日志，不调用模型、不联网。"
      },
